{"strongs": "H0041", "word": "אֲבִינָדָב", "translit": "a.vi.na.dav", "root": "אבה", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "my father is noble", "definition": "אֲבִינָדָב proper name, masculine ( my father is noble ) 1. a man of Gibeah in whose house the ark tarried 1Sam 7:1 ; 2Sam 6:3 (twice in verse); 2Sam 6:4 ; 1Chr 13:7 . 2. a son of Jesse 1Sam 16:8 ; 1Sam 17:13 ; 1Kgs 4:11 (? perhaps otherwise unknown; Klo proposes אֲבִינֵר בְּ ). 3. a son of Saul 1Sam 31:2 ; 1Chr 8:33 ; 1Chr 9:39 ; 1Chr 10:2 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB32')\">BDB32</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H41')\">H41</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB31')\">BDB31</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB33')\">BDB33</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אֲבִינָדָב</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (<highlight>my father is noble</highlight>) <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> a man of Gibeah in whose house the ark tarried <ref ref=\"1Sam 7:1\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(9,7,1)\">1Sam 7:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 6:3\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(10,6,3)\">2Sam 6:3</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"2Sam 6:4\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(10,6,4)\">2Sam 6:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 13:7\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(13,13,7)\">1Chr 13:7</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> a son of Jesse <ref ref=\"1Sam 16:8\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(9,16,8)\">1Sam 16:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 17:13\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(9,17,13)\">1Sam 17:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 4:11\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(11,4,11)\">1Kgs 4:11</ref> (? perhaps otherwise unknown; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Klo')\">Klo</lookup> proposes <bdbheb>אֲבִי